    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Proposed controls",
      "items": [
        "One campaign at a time. Runner egress allows approved targets only.",
        "Tools use a bounded model relay. Provider keys stay on the host."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Model choices",
      "items": [
        "Local-only mode blocks external inference. No cloud fallback.",
        "Grok API details need confirmation. A GPU host is a later option; no initial cluster."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Coverage and evidence",
      "items": [
        "SQLite tracks runs. Restricted folders hold artifacts. Back up both stores.",
